    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Zen Chess: Champion's Moves </strong>you will be put in the position of a World Chess Champion. Play through historical games and solve the same chess problems the champions had to solve to win each game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Solve <strong>150 chess puzzles</strong>, from historical games played by World Chess Champions;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Chess puzzles goes from <strong>Mate-in-One</strong> to <strong>Mate-in-Seven</strong> problems; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> For chess enthusiasts looking to perfect their game while enjoying a <strong>minimalist</strong>, <strong>beautifully designed </strong>chess board and pieces.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Can you play like a champion?</strong></p>",
